  "description": "A .NET library for running Segment Anything Model (SAM) and SAM2 using ONNX Runtime. Provides high-performance image segmentation capabilities with support for both SAM and MobileSAM models. Features include point-based prompting, bounding box prompts, and video frame tracking with temporal memory for SAM2.",
  "id": "SegmentAnything.Onnx",
